{
  "slug": "deep-review",
  "name": "Deep Review",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deep Review is a Claude Code plugin for rigorous review of papers and technical artifacts. Aiming to reduce \"edit volume\" for researchers and paper-reviewers, it adds a skill that interviews the user first, reads the artifact carefully, decomposes the review into specialist passes,  and verifies claims against sources or computations where possible. It also self-critiques findings, and returns a severity-ranked markdown review with evidence.\n\nIt is especially useful for pre-submission paper review, theorem/proof stress tests, empirical or methods audits, literature positioning, technical memos, and AI-generated draft review.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `deep-review` (Expert review workflow for papers, PDFs, arXiv links, markdown drafts, and technical artifacts).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install deep-review@claude-community` from `dipakkrishnan/deep-review-skill`.\n\nDeep Review is an experimental skill for rigorous review of papers and technical artifacts.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
